"The share URL always reflects the current page — no manual URL entry needed. "
"The linguaforge_social_share_url filter lets you override the resolved URL "
"for any service."
msgstr ""
"A URL de partilha reflete sempre a página atual — sem necessidade de entrada "
"manual de URL. O filtro linguaforge_social_share_url permite substituir a "
"URL resolvida para qualquer serviço."

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:124
